      R. Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشَلْشَلَ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (water) <i>fell in consecutive
drops.</i> (TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشَلْشَلَ دَمًا</span> <i>It</i> (a wound)
<i>dripped with blood in consecutive drops.</i> (TA.)
See also R. Q. 1, last sentence.

